## Baseline test

I entered 10 sample leads from our outreach tool into Attio by hand, as People records. Each lead needed a name, job title, email, company, Lead source, Lead status and a note.

How I chose the Lead status:
- Email sent, no reply yet = Contacted
- Replied = Qualified (or Contacted if the reply was not interested)
- Lead source was set to a new option, Outbound, because none of the existing options fitted

I also created one Deal for each lead:
- No reply = New
- Replied = Qualified

